.SH
L-dialcodes
.LP
This file contains entries with location abbreviations used
in the
.I L.sys
file (e.g. py, mh, boston).
The entry format is
.IP "" 12
abb\ \ dial-seq
.LP
where;
.RS
.IP abb 12
is the abbreviation,
.IP dial-seq
is the dial sequence to call that location.
.RE
.LP
The line
.IP "" 12
py\ \ 165\-
.LP
would be set up so that entry py7777 would
send 165\-7777 to the dial-unit.
